      "content": "i know you say that, but it doesn't feel that way. it feels like if i wasn't around, they could just start over, or at least stop carrying the weight of my failures every single day. it feels like the shame would just... go away if i wasn't there to represent it anymore. isn't there some kind of dignity in just letting go before it gets even worse?",
